# Ars Magica Fifth Edition, Houses of Hermes: True Lineages — House Mercere (Lore)

**Version:** 0.5.0
**Source:** Houses of Hermes: True Lineages (Atlas Games) — Ars Magica Fifth Edition, Chapter Three (pp. 78–109)
**Publisher:** Atlas Games

> Chapter Three’s narrative, verbatim: the founder Mercere, the four Redcap societies, and the
> magical Merceres. The chapter’s mechanics are structured records elsewhere — the laboratory and
> magic rules in `armdef-houses-true-lineages-0.5-mercere.ttrpg`, the Virtues and Flaws in
> `…-0.5-mercere-virtues-flaws.ttrpg`, the spells in `…-0.5-mercere-spells.ttrpg`, the sidebars in
> `…-0.5-mercere-sidebars.ttrpg`. The House itself is the canonical `^"House Mercere"` DEF in
> `armdef-0.5-houses.ttrpg`.

